WEBVTT

00:18:27.677 --> 00:18:32.457
(Music)

00:18:32.457 --> 00:18:36.665
♫ Jo Jo was a man who thought he was a loner ♫

00:18:36.665 --> 00:18:38.985
♫ but he was another man. ♫

00:18:38.985 --> 00:18:45.170
♫ Jo Jo left his home in Tucson, Arizona to attend a California bash. ♫

00:18:45.170 --> 00:18:48.113
♫ Get back, get back, ♫

00:18:48.113 --> 00:18:51.393
♫ get back to where you once belonged. ♫

00:18:51.393 --> 00:18:54.257
♫ Get back, get back, ♫

00:18:54.257 --> 00:19:03.720
♫ get back to where you once belonged. ♫